+- [#3532](https://github.com/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pull/3532) — **open**, R10-DUTY-SWITCH-RESTART-LEARNING-PR-B (part 2): r10 duty switch restart learning pr b p2 (R10-DUTY-SWITCH-RESTART-LEARNING-PR-B)
